Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.09,0:01:22.06,Title,,0,0,0,,{\pos(326.667,73)}Trickster Raccoon Dog
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.09,0:01:22.06,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fs26\pos(251.858,469)}Brought to you by: Ko-Fi.me/OrangeFlash
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.15,0:01:28.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I finished drawing!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.65,0:01:32.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Suneo, show me your sketch.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.40,0:01:34.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, it's you, Giant!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.65,0:01:35.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Have a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.86,0:01:37.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks so good.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.70,0:01:39.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Show me your sketch, Giant.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.37,0:01:41.74,Default,,0,0,0,,See?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.16,0:01:43.79,Default,,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.83,0:01:44.54,Default,,0,0,0,,An Elephant!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.79,0:01:47.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd expect nothing less from you, Giant.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.79,0:01:48.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It's huge and strong, just like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.54,0:01:49.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I know, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.79,0:01:52.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, Shizuka-{\i1}chan{\i0}! \NWhat did you sketch?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.13,0:01:53.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.71,0:01:55.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, have a look at my sketch.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.26,0:01:58.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Flamingo Couple, huh? Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.72,0:01:59.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.30,0:02:01.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Indeed!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.43,0:02:03.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no! You guys are flattering me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.81,0:02:06.14,Default,,0,0,0,,BTW, where is that Nobita and what's he up to?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.85,0:02:08.90,Default,,0,0,0,,He's probably still drawing, he's such a slowpoke!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.27,0:02:14.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew it, he hasn't finished his sketch.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.24,0:02:16.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Please don't move!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.36,0:02:18.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita-{\i1}san{\i0}, how's your drawing?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.03,0:02:20.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, you guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.49,0:02:24.66,Default,,0,0,0,,It isn't standing still at all, so my sketch is unfinished.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.66,0:02:26.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, a Cat? How cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.71,0:02:28.42,Default,,0,0,0,,But it's a Raccoon Dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.54,0:02:32.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Oi, Nobita!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.92,0:02:34.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.92,0:02:36.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I see, that's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.97,0:02:37.38,Default,,0,0,0,,What's up, Suneo?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.38,0:02:42.51,Default,,0,0,0,,In fact, I've always thought that Nobita's face resembled....
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.01,0:02:43.51,Default,,0,0,0,,My face?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.51,0:02:45.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Like what?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.43,0:02:48.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Like a Raccoon Dog!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.14,0:02:49.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Raccoon Dog?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.73,0:02:55.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Raccoon Dog, right!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.11,0:02:55.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I know, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.61,0:02:58.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't play tricks on us, Nobita!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.07,0:03:00.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it, Suneo!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.45,0:03:02.87,Default,,0,0,0,,But you laughed as well!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.83,0:03:06.87,Default,,0,0,0,,All of you didn't have to make fool out of me, you know!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.58,0:03:11.21,Default,,0,0,0,,What, a Raccoon Dog, they say?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.42,0:03:15.84,Default,,0,0,0,,How mean! They went way too much overboard this time!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.96,0:03:23.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't forgive them! I will make them pay!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.35,0:03:25.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Calm down, I was the one who's made fun of, not you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.68,0:03:31.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Aren't you angry at being called as a Raccoon Dog?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.44,0:03:36.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course I'm! After all, Suneo made fun of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.32,0:03:39.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, let's punish Suneo!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.57,0:03:42.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Raccoon Dog!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.82,0:03:46.83,Default,,0,0,0,,How mean of you, you also think I'm a Raccoon Dog?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.87,0:03:51.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Nope, this is the gadget which trick others.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.04,0:03:52.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.71,0:03:57.13,Default,,0,0,0,,You must have heard of the Shape-shifting Raccoon Dogs...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.13,0:04:01.76,Default,,0,0,0,,On foot of mountain, turning noon into night, misleading people....
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.88,0:04:04.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Making inedible stuff feels like it's edible.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.47,0:04:08.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Can this gadget easily trick people?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.52,0:04:15.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Yep, it's used in Haunted Parks in 22nd Century to fool people.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.19,0:04:19.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Reality feels like an alternative world.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.15,0:04:21.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Sounds so cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.03,0:04:23.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Did I wear it correctly?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.32,0:04:25.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Yep!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.53,0:04:26.58,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing, Nobita?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.58,0:04:27.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's Mum!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.83,0:04:28.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll play a trick on Mum...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.41,0:04:31.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobita, have some snack-...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.75,0:04:39.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I've brought your favorite Dorayaki for you, Lord Doraemon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.09,0:04:41.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be leaving now...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.26,0:04:48.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Mum was fooled completely.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.35,0:04:52.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Mum perceived me as a king!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.52,0:04:54.14,Default,,0,0,0,,This gadget is so cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.27,0:04:57.69,Default,,0,0,0,,After eating Dorayaki, let's go look for Suneo!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.94,0:05:03.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll get you fooled, Suneo!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.11,0:05:04.99,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Suneo!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.20,0:05:08.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I bought new intense Manga...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.24,0:05:12.20,Default,,0,0,0,,but Nobita's Raccoon Dog face distracts me...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.70,0:05:14.87,Default,,0,0,0,,it makes manga less funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.88,0:05:21.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Just you wait and see, Suneo!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.68,0:05:31.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, I was on the way...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.06,0:05:32.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I must hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.81,0:05:37.44,Default,,0,0,0,,He was made fool of!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.57,0:05:44.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm lost at this forest at the foothill!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.50,0:05:55.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no, a Wolf! Someone please save me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.46,0:05:57.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Please save me from this wolf!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.75,0:06:02.59,Default,,0,0,0,,He's so scared!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.59,0:06:05.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Suneo is perceiving the puppy as a wolf!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.30,0:06:11.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Phew! I'm saved!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.89,0:06:14.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Where am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.18,0:06:16.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm in the middle of nowhere!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.73,0:06:19.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel something off!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.15,0:06:22.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't scare me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.78,0:06:28.11,Default,,0,0,0,,It's become night only in a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.91,0:06:31.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm shivering, I must find a warm shelter!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.83,0:06:35.20,Default,,0,0,0,,What now?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.75,0:06:41.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Got you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.38,0:06:47.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, there's a mansion! I'm saved!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.72,0:06:49.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll stay here overnight!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.60,0:06:52.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Pardon me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.14,0:06:54.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Anybody home?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.97,0:06:56.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome, Young Master Suneo.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.81,0:07:01.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, I'd like to stay here for night.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.02,0:07:05.28,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about? Hurry, dig in.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.99,0:07:13.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Please have a rest!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.62,0:07:15.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks very much!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.75,0:07:20.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm saved! I'm warm and hungry!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.46,0:07:25.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder what's the dinner?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.97,0:07:32.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Sound of a knife?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.73,0:07:44.15,Default,,0,0,0,,He must be so tasty!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.15,0:07:46.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no, she's the Mountain Hag!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.15,0:07:48.15,Default,,0,0,0,,What now?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.28,0:07:52.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.16,0:07:55.95,Default,,0,0,0,,She's gonna eat me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.66,0:07:58.41,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Suneo?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.58,0:08:01.62,Default,,0,0,0,,How great! We fooled Suneo completely.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.79,0:08:05.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Now gimme back my gadget.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.55,0:08:10.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Please lend it to me for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.43,0:08:13.89,Default,,0,0,0,,How helpless! Ok, but only for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.89,0:08:15.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't get full of yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.85,0:08:17.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry! See ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.35,0:08:21.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder if he's gonna be alright? \NKnowing him...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.44,0:08:24.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh well, hope he'll manage it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.45,0:08:32.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Nobita, what are you up to?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.11,0:08:36.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Hah, you are a Raccoon Dog!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.24,0:08:41.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, I'll teach you a lesson!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.71,0:08:46.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I see, I was in middle of a journey...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.88,0:08:50.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Suneo, here you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.38,0:08:55.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Giant, glad I found you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.05,0:08:59.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm hungry, let's go look for food.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.73,0:09:05.81,Default,,0,0,0,,They don't even know that they are being fooled.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.52,0:09:08.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, Sat-{\i1}chan{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.07,0:09:10.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Sis!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.36,0:09:12.49,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.49,0:09:14.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's play Mummy game together.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.49,0:09:16.49,Default,,0,0,0,,It's boring all by myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.28,0:09:20.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure, I'll play with you, but only for a short while.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.41,0:09:24.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, there's a tea vendor. We're saved!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.79,0:09:26.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's dig in!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.25,0:09:31.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.88,0:09:36.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Will you guys join us in Mummy game?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.64,0:09:41.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd like to have dumplings!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.22,0:09:43.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Dumpling made out of flower!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.02,0:09:45.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, I'm digging in!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.77,0:09:52.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you serious, Takeshi-{\i1}san{\i0}?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.57,0:09:54.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll have these Manjuu.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.37,0:09:58.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Tasty!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.74,0:10:00.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Unbelievable, he's eating it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.58,0:10:05.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Instead of dumplings, I'll have Manjuu too.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.25,0:10:10.46,Default,,0,0,0,,How yum!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.84,0:10:14.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you guys making fool of us?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.97,0:10:16.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm stuffed. Thanks for the treat.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.76,0:10:21.43,Default,,0,0,0,,How mean!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.43,0:10:24.68,Default,,0,0,0,,How will you make up for my shopping?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.73,0:10:32.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no! I forgot to tell Nobita how to deactivate the Raccoon Dog!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.32,0:10:40.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so full!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.83,0:10:44.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, Giant, there's a hot spring.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.83,0:10:47.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.41,0:10:51.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's take a warm rest!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.96,0:10:57.80,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you guys up to?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.10,0:11:07.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Feels so good!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.06,0:11:14.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I tricked them to perceive the park pond as an hot spring! Haha!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.74,0:11:28.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Can I join you guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.66,0:11:30.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure, hop in!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.08,0:11:31.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Feels so warm!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.09,0:11:38.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it, you guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.01,0:11:41.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, it's Shizuka-{\i1}chan{\i0}'s voice. Wonder what's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.84,0:11:43.85,Default,,0,0,0,,what's the matter, Shizuka-{\i1}chan{\i0}?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.85,0:11:45.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.85,0:11:49.06,Default,,0,0,0,,i'm feeling so relaxed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.23,0:11:50.56,Default,,0,0,0,,True!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.36,0:11:54.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Suneo and Giant being there like that is not surprising...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.86,0:11:56.65,Default,,0,0,0,,But why is even Nobita-{\i1}kun{\i0} with them?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.65,0:11:58.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you making a fool out of yourself, Nobita-{\i1}kun{\i0}?